# Mercenary primaries

selectable-set-merc-wspr-name = WSPR
selectable-set-merc-wspr-description =
    Silenced, subsonic and caseless. Leaves no trace, and no witnesses.
    Includes: the WSPR rifle (9.5mm HP caseless), 2 magazines and a large ammo box.

selectable-set-merc-estoc-name = Estoc
selectable-set-merc-estoc-description =
    A marksman rifle for patient work. Pick your shot, end the argument.
    Includes: the Estoc DMR (.30 rifle), 2 magazines and a large ammo box.

selectable-set-merc-bandit-name = Bandit
selectable-set-merc-bandit-description =
    Bullpup precision, perfected by Scarborough Arms. Four magazines included - and still not enough.
    Includes: the Bandit DMR (.30 caseless), 4 magazines and a large ammo box.

selectable-set-merc-akm-name = AKM
selectable-set-merc-akm-description =
    Battered, ancient and utterly dependable. It has never once failed to fire.
    Includes: the AKM rifle (.30 rifle), 2 magazines and a large ammo box.

selectable-set-merc-enforcer-name = Enforcer
selectable-set-merc-enforcer-description =
    Semi-automatic and wide-choked. Nothing in the doorway stays standing.
    Includes: the Enforcer shotgun (12 Gauge), 2 buckshot boxes and an incendiary box.

selectable-set-merc-vulkan-m-name = Vulkan-M
selectable-set-merc-vulkan-m-description =
    A compact bullpup that never stops. Less recoil, tighter groups, full auto.
    Includes: the Vulkan-M rifle (.30 rifle), 2 magazines and a large ammo box.

# Mercenary sidearms

selectable-set-merc-svalinn-name = Svalinn
selectable-set-merc-svalinn-description =
    Cheap, modular and never out of ammo. A fatter cell means a fatter beam.
    Includes: the Svalinn laser pistol.

selectable-set-merc-energy-magnum-name = energy magnum
selectable-set-merc-energy-magnum-description =
    Three modes: lethal, window-piercing and disabling. Recharges itself.
    Includes: the energy magnum.

selectable-set-merc-cobra-name = Cobra
selectable-set-merc-cobra-description =
    Integrally suppressed and subsonic. Quiet work, quieter exit.
    Includes: the Cobra pistol (9.5mm HP caseless), 2 magazines and a small ammo box.

selectable-set-merc-viper-name = Viper
selectable-set-merc-viper-description =
    A machine pistol that punches above its weight. Semi-auto, or rock and roll.
    Includes: the Viper pistol (.35 auto), 2 magazines and a small ammo box.
